nityaṁ yajñe pratiṣṭhitam\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1070,\"bb\":955,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/15/b955/\",\"shadow_value\":\"karma – work; brahma – from the Vedas; udbhavam – produced; viddhi – you should know; brahma – the Vedas; akṣara – from the Supreme Brahman (Personality of Godhead); samudbhavam – directly manifested; tasmāt – therefore; sarva-gatam – all-pervading; brahma – transcendence; nityam – eternally; yajñe – in sacrifice; pratiṣṭhitam – situated.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"karma\",\"translation\":\"work\"},{\"word\":\"brahma\",\"translation\":\"from the Vedas\"},{\"word\":\"udbhavam\",\"translation\":\"produced\"},{\"word\":\"viddhi\",\"translation\":\"you should know\"},{\"word\":\"brahma\",\"translation\":\"the Vedas\"},{\"word\":\"akṣara\",\"translation\":\"from the Supreme Brahman (Personality of Godhead)\"},{\"word\":\"samudbhavam\",\"translation\":\"directly manifested\"},{\"word\":\"tasmāt\",\"translation\":\"therefore\"},{\"word\":\"sarva-gatam\",\"translation\":\"all-pervading\"},{\"word\":\"brahma\",\"translation\":\"transcendence\"},{\"word\":\"nityam\",\"translation\":\"eternally\"},{\"word\":\"yajñe\",\"translation\":\"in sacrifice\"},{\"word\":\"pratiṣṭhitam\",\"translation\":\"situated\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1071,\"bb\":956,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/15/b956/\",\"body_value\":\"Regulated activities are prescribed in the Vedas, and the Vedas are directly manifested from the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Consequently the all-pervading Transcendence is eternally situated in acts of sacrifice.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1072,\"bb\":957,\"url_path\":